    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Introduction to Korean Holidays)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My country has many traditional holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Holidays are a special time when families can get together"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and celebrate."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We celebrate Lunar New Year’s, Independence Day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Arbor Day, Buddha’s Birthday and many more."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I would like to tell you about the two largest traditional holidays"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "in Korea."
    },
